Literals in Xcode 27.0's ld layout (B-193, docs/formats/build.md "Objective-C references, archive members and hints in
the linked image"): the __literal4, __literal8 and __literal16 sections' literals go into __TEXT,__const in input
order, each at its first occurrence with its own alignment, the later equal ones folded into it. lld wrote them all
into a __TEXT,__literals section of its own, by size.
